    "detailed_description": "This story is about a group of sailors returning home after a long voyage. On the way home, they got into a strong storm which damaged their ship and threw them to some coast. Whether they were lucky or this is just the beginning of the adventure, let's find out.<br><br>In the game we tried to bring a retro vibes of old games from early 90's and added some new features. Here is a full list of features you'll meet:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 unique levels;<br></li><li>over 30 unique enemies;<br></li><li>18 spells;<br></li><li>procedural generation;<br></li><li>autosaving a progress;<br></li><li>good music, sounds;<br></li><li>no bugs :)</li></ul>",
